            "description": "Sets (or clears, by sending `jetsonHost: null`) the branch's device's reachable network address — the host + RTSP output port its annotated camera streams are published on. Keyed by branchId, so it works even before the device has activated. Does not touch DeviceId, credentials, or activation status."
          },
