            "description": "Paginated Alert list. All the optional filters (branchId, cameraId, className: gun|knife, status, snapshotAvailable, fromUtc/toUtc) are included but disabled — enable the ones you want to test. sortBy accepts detectedAtUtc or receivedAtUtc."
